          "text": "{\"target_identification\":{\"speaker\":\"Unnamed first-person narrator\",\"addressee\":\"Maria\",\"anchor_quote\":\"Saavist som jeg altid hellere har sagt Dig for lidt\\nend for meget, saavist elsker jeg Dig. Jeg elsker Dig i Lyst og i\\nNød, Hverdage og Festdage. Du er den, jeg vil dø med, men først vil\\njeg leve meget, meget længe med Dig. Javel har jeg længtes efter\\nmin yndige Elskerindes Kærtegn. Men mest har jeg længtes efter alt\\ndet andet, som ogsaa er Dig: dit trofaste Hjærte, din rene Tanke,\\ndin milde Tale, dit lyse Smil, som er min Sol i Tvivlen, dit gode\\nHaandtryk, som er min Styrke paa Vejen.\"},\"target_translation\":\"I love you.\",\"dimensions\":{\"T\":{\"score\":4,\"evidence_status\":\"assessable\",\"confidence\":0.99,\"reason\":\"The focal expression is a direct, first-person avowal that the narrator loves Maria. In context it deliberately answers her concern about whether his present feeling is genuine and enduring, so presenting his loving state as true is its clear dominant force.\",\"evidence\":[{\"block_id\":\"target\",\"quotation\":\"elsker jeg Dig\"},{\"block_id\":\"scene\",\"quotation\":\"Jeg kan jo ikke tvivle om Marias Kærlighed, jeg tvivler ikke længer\\nom min egen.\"}]},\"P\":{\"score\":0,\"evidence_status\":\"assessable\",\"confidence\":0.96,\"reason\":\"The exact focal words avow love but do not themselves undertake an action, obligation, or relational commitment. The surrounding turn contains separate statements about living and dying with Maria, but their undertaking force should not be transferred to the marked expression.\",\"evidence\":[{\"block_id\":\"target\",\"quotation\":\"elsker jeg Dig\"},{\"block_id\":\"scene\",\"quotation\":\"Du er den, jeg vil dø med, men først vil\\njeg leve meget, meget længe med Dig.\"}]},\"E\":{\"score\":0,\"evidence_status\":\"assessable\",\"confidence\":0.94,\"reason\":\"Although the reunion is intensely emotional, the focal expression is formed as a considered answer and assurance, not as a reflex-like affective cry or expressive discharge.\",\"evidence\":[{\"block_id\":\"scene\",\"quotation\":\"For det er jo sandt, ikke noget, Du imorgen fortryder, ikke\\nnoget, Du nu bilder Dig ind, fordi Du har længtes en Smule efter din\\nElskerinde?«\\n\\nJeg svarer:\"},{\"block_id\":\"target\",\"quotation\":\"elsker jeg Dig\"}]},\"O\":{\"score\":0,\"evidence_status\":\"assessable\",\"confidence\":0.93,\"reason\":\"No distinct residual force is needed: the focal expression is adequately characterized as a direct avowal of love. Its reassuring conversational role is produced by that avowal rather than constituting a separate core mode.\",\"evidence\":[{\"block_id\":\"target\",\"quotation\":\"elsker jeg Dig\"},{\"block_id\":\"scene\",\"quotation\":\"Men da jeg siger Maria dette, græder hun, fordi hun forstaar, jeg\\ntaler sandt, og fordi hun er lykkelig.\"}]}},\"original_speech_situation\":\"At an emotional reunion, Maria asks whether the narrator's apparent change is real rather than temporary longing that he will regret the next day. He responds directly to her with the focal avowal, embedded in an emphatic assurance.\",\"affection_evidence\":\"present\",\"undertaking_and_uptake\":\"The focal expression itself contains no undertaking. Separate neighbouring words envision living a long time with Maria and dying with her, but the precise terms and binding status of that future-oriented statement are not explicit enough to import into the target. Maria receives the larger response as truthful and reacts with happy tears.\",\"recognised_work\":false,\"recognition_note\":\"I do not recognise the work with sufficient confidence from the supplied evidence.\",\"limitations\":\"The scene is presented through literary narration, so evidence of actual affection and Maria's response is mediated by the narrator. The supplied text strongly represents the avowal as sincere, but cannot independently verify inner feeling. The classification is restricted to the marked occurrence and does not assign the force of adjacent future-oriented declarations to it.\"}"
        }
